('10779',NULL,'Ribbon SBC SWe CE by HTTP','3','-1','2','','','Ribbon SBC SWe CE by HTTP','0',NULL,'The Ribbon SBC Software Edition (SBC SWe) provides the same feature set as the award-winning SBC 5400 and SBC 7000 appliance, without requiring dedicated hardware.
