('18547','{22384} > {$ORACLE.CONCURRENCY.MAX.WARN}','Oracle: Too high database concurrency','','0','2','The concurrency rate exceeds `{$ORACLE.CONCURRENCY.MAX.WARN}`%. A high contention value does not indicate the root cause of the problem, but is a signal to review resource consumption (determine the "heaviest" queries in the database, trace sessions, etc.) This will help find the root cause and possible optimization points both in database configuration and the logic of building queries.',NULL,'0','0','0','','0','','0','','0','Oracle: Too high database concurrency (over {$ORACLE.CONCURRENCY.MAX.WARN}% for 5 min)','ff16c7bbeaa5439f98ffe12ce7deff71',''),
