('29818','{$JUNIPER.MX.NET.IF.CONTROL:"{#IFNAME}"}=1 and {43726}=2 and ({43726}<>{43727})','Juniper MX: Interface [{#IFNAME}][{#IFDESCR}]: Link down','','0','3','This trigger expression works as follows:
1. It can be triggered if the operational status is down.
