('33075','{49122} > {$PG.REPLICATION.SLOTS.RETAINING.MAX.WARN}','PostgreSQL: Replication slots: Inactive slots are retaining WAL','','0','2','Inactive replication slots are holding WAL segments. Check whether the consumers are gone for good and drop the slots that are no longer needed.',NULL,'0','2','0','','0','','0','','0','PostgreSQL: Replication slots: Inactive slots are retaining WAL (over {$PG.REPLICATION.SLOTS.RETAINING.MAX.WARN} for 5m)','724f9ec933de4e4c8f533c99ad900441',''),
