('33083','{49130} > {$PG.TABLESPACE.SIZE.MAX.HIGH:"{#TABLESPACE.NAME}"}','PostgreSQL: Tablespace [{#TABLESPACE.NAME}]: Size is critically big','','0','4','The tablespace "{#TABLESPACE.NAME}" is close to exhausting its storage. Free up space or move relations to another tablespace - a full disk stops the instance from accepting writes.',NULL,'0','2','0','','0','','0','','0','PostgreSQL: Tablespace [{#TABLESPACE.NAME}]: Size is critically big (over {$PG.TABLESPACE.SIZE.MAX.HIGH:"{#TABLESPACE.NAME}"} for 5m)','3077825ff6e24c508027299f70831904',''),
