('29127','{42504}=2','Zabbix server: Proxy [{#PROXY.NAME}]: Zabbix proxy is outdated','','0','2','Zabbix proxy version is older than server version, but is partially supported. Only data collection and remote execution is available.','29106','0','2','0','','0','','0','Current value: {ITEM.LASTVALUE1}','0','','',''),
