({50316}<>2)','Linux: Interface {#IFNAME}: Ethernet has changed to lower speed than it was before','','0','1','This Ethernet connection has transitioned down from its known maximum speed. This might be a sign of autonegotiation issues. Acknowledge to close the problem manually.','31094','0','2','1','({50313}>0 and {50317}>0) or
